      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd3ed8de9bb9c7f0f788b665",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸……呼……我、我会加油的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0319cb2c26865c149e0998b9a5a750c1add3341c02f62e4aff8aa11e18762548",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37a57edba3a6e2c48f5a021a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要当作是在比赛就好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f17e23b440bc0e6940fa8bda97f46aec84ad36f3783152d027f80ced51b3304b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa30efd8b7d6e2c0623cfc16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起以胜利为目标，\r\n继续成长进步吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "974c8ca515a610b2e65bc8b8e320db74a99f0545969d0e19e9d25ed0b12e44d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e123e6925d2033018abb1a06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了训练员，\r\n我才终于能够正视自己的问题。\r\n真的很感谢你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2008c864933eb9b3cdb141633d5b72c2a092eaffba8b78ab5201807e56dd337c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4060f2a7fedb9edabfb73693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然可能不太适合我就是了……\r\n啊哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86175c667365f0882e7212b18d6d2204c677852be9d52e4199a85da44e599a3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:794fee7c419bd8114d4b7822",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这……会不会有点太可爱了啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "478cc369197e3db7dbb37e5a325bcb7604799ec4784023fe54b6ac7eb6fb82d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:174a3607c86c8a94281fd782",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干劲、勇气、肌肉，全都很充足！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3474c11ecb7eabe5e0aa59a79d11030f57834d938ca05a491a5f3e4eac4c189",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0435c165ab3607975627cd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……这裙子会不会有点太短了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b8ddbbff6b04565a51fd0ac31aa8eaed52e69db944c898934d6fc4d1cbec1ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2c49cc9db5a70f9786c5ae1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也要习惯穿这样的衣服才行呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41f81d07bc5c4381b377d70ccbc1de7324dd0e016eb2f32ce5e909a241549eeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:953045164a2eb7dc47503904",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个衣服……很适合肌肉耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68df428987f60d17c46141b24c6fcb36afd24f43a6968cc19a5071dbf792332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54075142e78e428cbf486357",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会潇洒地帮助你鼓起勇气的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffcdc7d29fcc3fb7a662de5ee4084c79533aabbcb947c71ed170259352bb33d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd291c9e83bd2d43b50b14ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怀表，是能制作美味饮品的专家\r\n所拥有的证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ebdbd6a2a0eef876da063b3733c15c3b0c2348c6c28d4a12f7d0db3c146e3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92256c2ab1ed67cd2dcffcf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's muscle！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdbdaf8691b461350dd6d9f21b0d23c172260ff3fc77e89fe83e1c1d2b4f5a30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8e15ca17bbc9f38a4f4df16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70cf5af384b541c95e8c097e3524903e779ce3bb87c95addd7d74ba0114e8ffa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f4f31420d369a655531b4a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "算是我……用自己的方式在挑战吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5daa933391d772fe927cef5d370173aba2457d2c50a71dd108d3c4d496c25af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:366ee40e37bc956618fcab6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果轻飘飘的程度，\r\n和这件长版上衣差不多的话……嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78d2282b4b20c109a7226f67b175b288b03472d946acdd010a60fb3084407bdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
