    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22983d87cbc4b65afac2e6ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也要习惯穿这样的衣服才行呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41f81d07bc5c4381b377d70ccbc1de7324dd0e016eb2f32ce5e909a241549eeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2211bb8292a0964804cb2471",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个衣服……很适合肌肉耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68df428987f60d17c46141b24c6fcb36afd24f43a6968cc19a5071dbf792332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca564eae8a3e4ce059413458",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会潇洒地帮助你鼓起勇气的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffcdc7d29fcc3fb7a662de5ee4084c79533aabbcb947c71ed170259352bb33d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bbdbc956ba50ec1ef0e9674",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怀表，是能制作美味饮品的专家\r\n所拥有的证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ebdbd6a2a0eef876da063b3733c15c3b0c2348c6c28d4a12f7d0db3c146e3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b97ca8377d0af02a27a6473",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's muscle！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdbdaf8691b461350dd6d9f21b0d23c172260ff3fc77e89fe83e1c1d2b4f5a30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0d7717be5c7a475202470ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70cf5af384b541c95e8c097e3524903e779ce3bb87c95addd7d74ba0114e8ffa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab13ee81865a3b1dc1a2a46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2a2f2dd22d880d9e216d4d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也是目白家的赛马娘！\r\n我要拿下这场比赛的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dfccb0fe3cf80bd498eb0754eb17ccca0d606f6da7ff328b6c760d2a050237f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27b64f7c2d1d6352745c43d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉肌肉的热身已经做得差不多了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16b3e20a37e11dd186b186ed35d248386adb713d64536d0c3cb3d7a9bddfaae2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29521dae653622e0c9fea332",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！今天也是个舒服的早晨呢。\r\n在上课之前我先去跑一趟好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81fc68eb31da29f23a2d3f4d038534dcfdff18fc8356ccef8ea726a9baa1adcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77d4b571fe9d588252a998f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "维他命、矿物质、蛋白质，\r\n一早就都补充完毕了。\r\n为的是能够一直努力到晚上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48f1e73ca87e31bccb9c9d29e6c4a5ef8cf341751a9c7d84f3cfa515e47efdff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd316e6945de00888c87acb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午安！今天我们要做什么训练啊？\r\n是重训还是耐力跑！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e8f8528ab77a5def7fde5ddb6d1f24dc3e90f4022a4138ad3191ecea811fed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33d09e027e19f2e14c735d58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，要不要跟我一起补充蛋白质？\r\n最近的产品味道越来越讲究了，\r\n很容易上瘾哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "822cdbdcb0518e1ec4ac25e05e5df06d8dcadac61019e5b46bc633d8d8c9121e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25b21706732b2d47cc83bb6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上一定要好好地睡觉哦。\r\n睡眠不足是会导致集中力\r\n跟新陈代谢急遽下降的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "995daa4e574f387451b8bc5553aea427ec6c51935ae6723ba8bde6d088e1491f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6885ba7551714b33ceaeca7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天要做什么好呢……\r\n想要锻炼腹肌，\r\n又想要锻炼竖脊肌……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c41763fd106ece3eb4bd126f5d7560e1e5de5cd3d0c5361df058b0584e42502e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc6648afda84b7e75f0a135c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "充满春天气息的洋装真好看……\r\n麦昆跟多伯穿起来\r\n一定很适合的吧……嗯～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c81ec0485c26c9d81d83a529c05811fb01012370bc6d8857903e508b13a9114",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60126e00c5458cad1447bf95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "炎热的夏天就一定要待在健身房！\r\n完全不用烦恼温度跟湿度的问题，\r\n可以100％全力投入训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24762dd7e0784d0ec10205c8691dffb67952a0e7c81db89be17288fb4b4d649d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13fc024fea0a65cc7724beb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要赏红叶的话，我推荐去山里看哦！\r\n顺便还可以做高地训练，\r\n好好提升我的心肺功能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "124c1507fe033533c0160f1cd01a36b5d52517ad62702918e618a76a8c32038c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46ddd6cd9730ef08f39c64a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷的时候就更该做运动来温暖身心！\r\n我们一起来锻炼肌肉吧！\r\nLet's muscle！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb5a971caf12870438cdbe93d29963899af3e88cf3d5a890aa21effc7e4a51b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d9b9d7db707535d1f33a24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！\r\n为了开始充满活力的一天，\r\n请享用这根乳清蛋白巧克力棒吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7757c00a31e6f3330cc0b74a2a01a596ed949823873161adc6a7c0c42b219700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e4a64d1a5b4939172034a01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝杯咖啡醒醒脑如何？\r\n我来泡杯让人一大早就能\r\n做完十组卧推的能量咖啡吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05e4355d79b5a4a30819ad3267e6114d0ce6a3f2a0880d8953c3f9d0b103a42f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8622802b86fd88ae019afc45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐时间来一客鸡胸肉色拉\r\n怎么样？……啊，没有啦，\r\n我在模仿漫画上看到的店长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81cd9d5db78b1dce29545d75f10add350a689bf465abb2c5c01dfa049723b13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0344766d10ed45141867ac49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐后来杯热腾腾的咖啡如何？\r\n嘿嘿，其实咖啡因\r\n对重训也有帮助喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5df466706856b653f45089c55ca88c88f800d28e6e80b0fac3cab88b88759ce3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84484e038f7b0bb23d5ee273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来泡杯加了\r\n乳清蛋白的热牛奶给你吧。\r\n我每天晚上都会喝一杯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ff5de695b5483dc03ceabe13606b45d504c38dc3ef5ffd88af4e1238cdd201",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc80e039034a8fe517dcbdb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看生生正忙着做事，便悄悄地\r\n为她递上了一杯咖啡……连我自己\r\n都觉得这举动真帅气呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5aaec5bfbd830a3f9bb34333f3284549dd898d3afdd2665a552525b2460bcd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f53a0966fa85ba0341e3f30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是心念一转的季节！\r\n今年我一定要成为能够潇洒地\r\n辅助他人的成熟赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bb205984620823df00abec34ddc0d49ee90d9f4f5c603b85cada7f4d3654148",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b567253ebf4087c6283cb0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气太热没食欲时，要不要喝杯\r\n蜂蜜柠檬麦茶呢？打起精神，\r\n一起培养强健的体格吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3525088434d05c76b7fef2306887f6b685d9a0771ad3a9bffaf8fb1987726763",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:192f86abd50531b44d5a068e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运动之秋也是读书之秋！所以呢，\r\n我打算挑战边骑室内脚踏车\r\n边读完一整本文库本！",
      "source_fingerprint": "325ee2e21f53052cc971f370713e01d16598a4c932fd777acbcbdf9aad0dec3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e062f60d6eda35d8ae12591",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝杯暖～暖的热可可能让全身\r\n由内到外暖和起来喔。不然的话\r\n只有重训可以达到相同效果了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bab6e0c53eafbf27f996eab3aaa83fea7b3bef051b2d19294077d642730ada66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:679cd013a4f6ffce2fa86a06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cefc57db35c3e5579010b44e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:233a40005485aba875efc925",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次见到麦昆都会感受到她的成长，\r\n有种虽然在我身边却离我很\r\n遥远的感觉……也许是我多想了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bf1874a50bb2712822c18fe8e4045855168d7ba1975d2aeb7212e07f6de656c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81ba2170706c8ac860e19e49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "艾尼推荐的衣服真的机动性很高哦！\r\n嘿嘿，帮她挑一双运动鞋当回礼好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0f330532ac76d6c7df18c7a099e5e953a0bfedccaf0cad0535b42c8d7b185da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ca2f6fb4e390571a6c06178",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢短发哦。\r\n不只好活动，洗头也很轻松。\r\n外观上我也觉得这样最适合自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d687de97f6b02b0eb60caa8a8fe6f8dd74651e0e14bc38c891fb6b704f056d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91002"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
